Future Extensibility Notes

To add a third shop ("Fluffy Friends"), you would only need to:

Create app/infrastructure/fluffy_friends_adapter.rb inheriting from AdapterBase.
Implement its specific authentication (if needed), pagination, and parser (CSV, GraphQL, etc.).
Add it to the dependency injection container or simply instantiate it in the controller alongside others.
No changes are required in Dealer, existing adapters, or database schemas.
